      Broadening the horizon in land use change modelling: Normative scenarios for nature positive futures in Switzerland

        Regional Environmental Change, 24
         · Black, B. and Adde, A. and Farinotti, D. and Guisan, A. and Külling, N. and Kurmann, M. and Martin, C. and Mayer, P. and Rabe, S and Streit, J. and Zekollari, H. and Grêt-Regamey, A.


