  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual model checks help:&lt;/strong&gt; Looking at transitions separately exposes weak areas like data imbalance.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predictor selection improves models:&lt;/strong&gt; Removing unnecessary inputs improved performance, especially for logistic regression.&lt;/li&gt;
